The issue here appears to be incompatible BioC versions. Notice the paths generated:

    http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc/bin/windows/contrib/3.0

The base comes from Packrat, and has 2.14, but is completed with 3.0. I imagine this is because we are seeing an incorrect version of BiocInstaller on the path?

I think a fix would involve us manually constructing these URLs, I think, and only respecting what we see in the Packrat lockfile -- but let me know if you can think of a local workaround as well.

Thanks,
Kevin

