Right — alternatively, you could add something to your project-local .Rprofile like:
if (file.exists("~/.Rprofile")) source("~/.Rprofile")

or we could even consider allowing users to opt-in to sourcing ~/.Rprofile on packrat::init() (ie, automatically adding that code to the auto-loader), but this does break isolation a bit.
​

